# A Tale for the Ages {1}{W}: "Enchanted creatures you control get +2/+2." Bot1's Memnite wears Bot1's own Pacifism and becomes
# 3/3 once the Tale is in play; its unenchanted Ornithopter stays 0/2. On turn three Bot1 puts a second Pacifism on Bot2's
# Ornithopter: an enchanted creature, but not one Bot1 controls, so it stays 0/2 (CR 303.4, 613.4c). The Tale is no Aura, so it
# enchants nothing.

